# REST

# Login
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "rememberMe": false
}


###
# Register
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "firstName": "",
    "lastName": ""
}




###
# Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}



###
# Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {your_token}